        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWKuRqwDtvkO_0NpximU7CqvQb799JBobNSs__Uj8vekNheWvNG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Great selection of products (jewels of all types and colors), good customer service. Clean.",
        "time": 1751477604,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shayla Diaz",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106356617183377662467/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUMtXJGTMerm72mwwSDMBocxxugB_qDNoUA-Wjivfqqc7uNWCskFQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "The guy who tattooed me and my mother wasn’t really nice, I had given him a drawing I had already done and he changed my drawing and I had told him the designs that he did I didn’t really like them and he got upset over it, and I felt obligated to like what ever he drew. And he had told my mother that he didn’t want to tattoo in a area she wanted and a week later he posted a tattoo he had done in the same area she wanted. And for a fine line tattoo it’s honestly really patchy and ugly, I don’t recommend this tattoo place unless you want to be guilted into getting something you didn’t want. Also really expensive for no reason charged us 200$ for two fine line tattoos",
        "time": 1761683166,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Freddie Thornton",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112783230121937154981/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU5xDeMG9coA7qEU1hnCWrWPZovPpKJX83_x1AJCgLoo-yuGV_i=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Amazing staff!! They’re all very patient and wonderful, although some are sadly not the most attentive. Every time I’ve gone for a piercing here, they use the wrong jewelry. I’ve always had to go check my healing process out at another place (since I’ve had problems healing) and have them tell me it was pierced incorrectly and with the wrong jewelry (size and backings). It’s happened multiple times, with my first three lobes and nostril.",
        "time": 1739798432,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kimberly Demers",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102839850042497248308/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWRZKItDEqXfm-dFmJkh1ECHOO0v22IcSfLIG-mkbt-Ar6SZrqX=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I went here in a desperate attempt to save a botched piercing job at another establishment that claimed to be professional. I was served by Manu who was the sweetest person ever. She explained every step to me, helped me pick out a new stud to help with my piercing bump and gave me a detailed plan on how to care for my piercing properly. I can only hope that my nose continues to heal but one thing is for sure, this place really has a great team to help you.",
        "time": 1743317744,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alaura GK.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107588063340558638308/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW4CD485w7Ia9sAmw4rW2LnpvQGCDQJKlO9SVrT76n87cGBkoXv=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Today was my first visit here for piercing switch. I was having hard time switching the jewel. They did it in few minutes. Omg m so happy 💁🏻‍♀️ will definitely go back in future thankyou so much you guys are best 😤🤌🏻❤️",
        "time": 1748108104,
        "translated": false
      }
